  "description": "Modern Two-Bedroom Apartment – Excellent East Wall Location\n\nDanny Byrne & Byrne Real Estate are delighted to present this well-located two-bedroom apartment at 27 Church Road, East Wall, Dublin 3.\n\nThe property offers bright and comfortable accommodation in a convenient location, making it an ideal home for those looking to live close to Dublin city centre.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, spacious living/dining area, fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom.\n\nThe apartment is ideally located within easy reach of Dublin city centre, the IFSC, Dublin Docklands and Dublin Port. East Wall and the surrounding areas offer a good selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\n\nThere are excellent public transport links nearby, with regular bus services providing easy access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The location also provides convenient access to major road networks.\n\nAccommodation includes:\n• Entrance Hall\n• Living/Dining Area\n• Fully Fitted Kitchen\n• Two Bedrooms\n• Main Bathroom\n\nLocation:\n27 Church Road is ideally positioned in East Wall, providing tenants with the convenience of city living while benefiting from a well-established residential neighbourhood.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.",
